«
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  TriAsymArgs
  @  Returns the parameters tagged with their names.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 4; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 4 ≠ THEN "TriAsymArgs: needs 4 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → Xminv Xmaxv xpv Xv « Xminv 0 + Xmaxv 0 + xpv 0 + Xv 0 + → Xmin Xmax xp X « Xmin "Xmin" →Tag Xmax "Xmax" →Tag xp "xp" →Tag X "X" →Tag Xminv Xmaxv xpv Xv 4 →List Drop » »
»
